@startuml 06-level-runtime
!pragma layout smetana
title Runtime del livello — Facade di caricamento e sottosistemi TMX

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

class "map/levels.yaml" as LevelsYaml <<YAML>>
class "map/levels/<id>/level.yaml" as LevelYaml <<YAML>>
class "map/levels/<id>/level.tmx" as LevelTmx <<TMX>>

package "Catalogo e validazione" {
  interface LevelAssetResolver <<Gateway>>
  class LevelAssetResolvers <<Factory>>
  class LevelCatalog <<Catalog>>
  class LevelManifest <<DTO>>
  class LevelDefinition <<DTO>>
  class CheckpointDefinition <<DTO>>
  class LevelAssetValidator <<Validator>>
  class GameStartupValidator <<Validator>>
  class LevelValidationResult <<DTO>>
}

package "Caricamento runtime" {
  class SceneController <<Application Facade>> {
    + loadLevel(id): LevelRuntime
    + unloadCurrentLevel(): void
  }
  class TmxLevelLoader <<Loader>>
  class LevelRuntime
  class TmxLevel
  class TmxMapContract <<Contract>>
  class IsoMapGeometry <<Service>>
}

package "Sottosistemi del livello" {
  class PhysicsFacade <<Facade>>
  class MapPhysicsBuilder <<Builder>>
  class EnemyEncounterService <<Service>>
  class CheckpointService <<Service>>
  class TmxCollectibleLoader <<Loader>>
  class CollectibleService <<Service>>
  class NpcInteractionService <<Service>>
  class LevelScreen <<Boundary>>
  class CharacterFactory <<external>>
  class CollectibleFactory <<external>>
  class NpcFactory <<external>>
}

LevelsYaml --> LevelCatalog
LevelYaml --> LevelDefinition
LevelDefinition *-- "0..*" CheckpointDefinition
LevelCatalog *-- "1..*" LevelDefinition
LevelCatalog --> LevelAssetResolver
LevelAssetResolvers ..> LevelAssetResolver
LevelAssetValidator --> LevelAssetResolver
LevelAssetValidator --> LevelCatalog
LevelAssetValidator ..> LevelValidationResult
GameStartupValidator --> LevelAssetValidator

SceneController --> LevelCatalog
SceneController --> TmxLevelLoader
SceneController *-- LevelRuntime : scena attiva
TmxLevelLoader ..> TmxLevel
LevelRuntime *-- LevelDefinition
LevelRuntime *-- TmxLevel
LevelTmx --> TmxLevelLoader
TmxLevel *-- IsoMapGeometry
TmxLevel --> TmxMapContract

SceneController ..> LevelScreen : crea boundary
LevelScreen --> LevelRuntime
LevelScreen *-- PhysicsFacade
PhysicsFacade --> TmxLevel
PhysicsFacade ..> MapPhysicsBuilder : costruisce corpi
LevelScreen *-- EnemyEncounterService
EnemyEncounterService --> CharacterFactory
EnemyEncounterService --> TmxLevel
LevelScreen *-- CheckpointService
CheckpointService --> LevelRuntime
LevelScreen --> TmxCollectibleLoader
TmxCollectibleLoader --> CollectibleFactory
TmxCollectibleLoader --> TmxLevel
LevelScreen *-- CollectibleService
LevelScreen *-- NpcInteractionService
NpcInteractionService --> NpcFactory
NpcInteractionService --> TmxLevel

note bottom of SceneController
Pattern principale: Facade.
SceneController nasconde catalogo, caricamento TMX,
creazione del LevelRuntime e sostituzione della scena attiva.
Factory non è principale: crea collaboratori specifici,
ma la force centrale è orchestrare più sottosistemi del livello.
end note
@enduml
